Subject: [PATCH] Carpet scope world command rules to native context

From Lophine 7a51f49a, Minecraft 0131, 0134. See META-INF/licenses/carpet-26.3.txt.
Retain the existing Brigadier permissions and Folia work, scope soft parsing to block placement arguments and require per-session confirmation.

Additional source:
